msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:5
msgid "Adding a Host to an Existing Cluster"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:7
msgid ""
"Hosts can be added to an existing HVM cluster to increase compute "
"capacity or improve failure tolerance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:9
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:80
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:9
msgid ""
"The agent quorum, Corosync, DLM, and GFS2 details on this page apply to "
"layouts 1.3 and 2.0. See :doc:`/infrastructure/clusters/mvm` for Legacy "
"host management."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:12
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:112
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:14
msgid "Before adding a new host:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:16
msgid ""
"The new host meets all requirements listed in :doc:`building_clusters` "
"(OS, CPU, memory, network, storage)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:17
msgid ""
"The new host has network connectivity to all existing cluster hosts on "
"port 7443"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:18
msgid "Shared storage (iSCSI targets) is accessible from the new host"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:19
msgid "Sufficient license capacity is available"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:22
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:123
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:24
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster]``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:25
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ Add Worker`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:26
msgid "Provide the new host's SSH IP, hostname, and credentials"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:27
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Complete`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:30
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:133
msgid "What Happens Automatically"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:32
msgid ""
"When a host is added to a layout 1.3 or 2.0 cluster, |morpheus| performs "
"the following automated operations:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Package installation and host preparation** — The same provisioning "
"phases run as during initial cluster creation (KVM, Corosync, DLM, "
"layout-specific networking, firewall, libvirt)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Corosync authkey distribution** — The cluster's Corosync authentication"
" key is retrieved from Cypher and installed on the new host"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Corosync configuration update** — The new host's node block is added to"
" ``corosync.conf`` on all existing hosts, the ``config_version`` is "
"incremented, and ``corosync-cfgtool -R`` is run on each host to reload "
"the configuration live (no restart required)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:40
msgid ""
"**DLM join** — The new host joins the DLM cluster and gains access to "
"existing lockspaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:42
msgid ""
"**GFS2 journal addition** — For each HPE Clustered Datastore (Shared "
"LUN), a new journal is added using ``gfs2_jadd`` if the current journal "
"count is less than the new total node count"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:44
msgid ""
"**iSCSI target discovery** — All configured iSCSI targets are discovered "
"and auto-logged-in on the new host"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Quorum list update** — |morpheus| sends updated ``quorumInfo`` to all "
"agents in the cluster (including the new host). Each agent persists the "
"updated member list to ``.quorum-nodes`` and begins peer-to-peer quorum "
"pinging with the new host"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Storage pool creation** — libvirt storage pools are created on the new "
"host for each existing datastore"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:51
msgid "Quorum Impact"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/managing_hosts.rst:53
msgid "Adding a host changes the quorum majority calculation:"
msgstr ""

